  "analysis": {
    "business_summary": "Vishay makes discrete semiconductors (MOSFETs, diodes, optoelectronics) and passive components (resistors, inductors, capacitors) sold into industrial, automotive, computing and power-infrastructure end markets. Its breadth of catalog parts makes it a bellwether for the electronic-component cycle rather than a single-product story.",
